# OTP email template (UTF-8). Copy to .env to customize locally.
# Use KEY=value without quotes, \n for line breaks, and keep {otp} in the body.
MAIL_OTP_SUBJECT=NMS - Password reset verification code
MAIL_OTP_BODY=Your password reset code is: {otp}\nThis code expires in 5 minutes and can only be used once.\nAfter verification, set a new password. If your account is locked, it will also be unlocked.\nIf you did not request this, ignore this email.
